    "V2-T": "R_X = [sum_s c(DTB,s)/sum_s N(DTB,s)] / [sum_s c(X,s)/sum_s N(X,s)] (c = primary cluster count, N = calls). SUPPORTED iff R_T1.0 >= 1.5 and R_T1.6 >= 1.5 and r_X,s > 1 for both temperature arms and both seeds and R_RPB >= 1.2 and mean_s G200(DTB best) <= min_X mean_s G200(X best). DISCONFIRMED iff R_T1.0 <= 1.0 or R_T1.6 <= 1.0. PARTIAL otherwise with named branches.",
